# CBPT (andrillon) curated results — current-formula CSVs + paper figures only.
# Quadratic-spec model dirs (onoff_valence_valence_sq_..._time_sq_...) and
# per-marker diagnostic PDFs/PNGs/SVGs/pkl stay ignored (regenerable from the
# pipeline); only the two oversized combined SVGs (non-LFS, >10MB) are excluded.
!results/andrillon_cluster/
results/andrillon_cluster/**
!results/andrillon_cluster/*.csv
results/andrillon_cluster/omnibus_test_QUADRATIC_SUPERSEDED.csv
!results/andrillon_cluster/paper_figures/
